From:      Valid, ~Frozen, ~Missing
To:        Valid, ~Missing, ~SameAsFrom
Amount:    Normal, ExactLimit, ~Zero, ~Negative, ~OverBalance, ~OverLimit
Currency:  Same, Different
DailyUsed: Empty, ~AlmostFull

# ~ already isolates the errors, but ExactLimit is still only meaningful here:
IF [Amount] = "ExactLimit" THEN [Currency] = "Same" AND [DailyUsed] = "Empty";
